From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] wordcraft-web: the host bridge forwards the plugin messages
 to the extension

Phase 7 WP4 (docs/phase7/PLAN.md section 4.6, docs/plugins.md "The web bridge"). In host mode every `wordcraft:plugin*` message from the parent page is handed to `docs_office::plugin_web::incoming`; after each frame `docs_office::plugin_web::sync` runs the queued ones against the session and returns the editor's messages (calls with transferred ArrayBuffers, done notices), which are posted to the parent with `post_message_with_transfer`. The protocol itself (pending invocations, input lock, timeout, restore) lives in our crates `docs-plugins::bridge` and `docs-office::plugin_web`; this patch is only the transport seam. Without the `office-ext` feature nothing changes.
---
 apps/wordcraft-web/src/web/host.rs | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/apps/wordcraft-web/src/web/host.rs b/apps/wordcraft-web/src/web/host.rs
index ec64425..c6f22e5 100644
--- a/apps/wordcraft-web/src/web/host.rs
+++ b/apps/wordcraft-web/src/web/host.rs
@@ -34,6 +34,10 @@
 //! - `wordcraft:focusOut` (to the parent): `{ palette }`, the user pressed F6 (leave the editor, `palette`
 //!   false) or F1 (open the command palette, `palette` true); a canvas swallows Tab, so these are the
 //!   keyboard way out.
+//! - `wordcraft:plugins`, `wordcraft:pluginActions` (from the parent) and `wordcraft:pluginsSet`,
+//!   `wordcraft:pluginCall`, `wordcraft:pluginDone` (to the parent): the plugin bridge, handled by
+//!   `docs_office::plugin_web` (docs/plugins.md, "The web bridge"). The page runs the plugin in a
+//!   Worker; the editor is the executor, locks input while a call is pending and restores on failure.
 //! - `wordcraft:failed` (to the parent): `{ error }` when the app couldn't start or save, or lost
 //!   its WebGL context (`webglcontextlost`: the page can't be drawn again, reload it).
 //!
@@ -212,6 +216,10 @@ impl Bridge {
             app.canvas.want_focus = true;
             ctx.request_repaint();
         }
+        #[cfg(feature = "office-ext")]
+        if docs_office::plugin_web::sync(&mut app.session, &|m, transfer| self.parent.post_message_with_transfer(m, &self.origin, transfer).is_ok()) {
+            ctx.request_repaint_after(std::time::Duration::from_millis(100));
+        }
         for ok in self.acks.take() {
             if self.pending.get() == 0 {
                 break;
@@ -352,6 +360,8 @@ impl Bridge {
                     }
                 }
                 Some("wordcraft:saved") => bridge.acks.borrow_mut().push(bool_field(&data, "ok")),
+                #[cfg(feature = "office-ext")]
+                Some(plugin) if plugin.starts_with("wordcraft:plugin") => docs_office::plugin_web::incoming(&data),
                 _ => return,
             }
             ctx.request_repaint();
